<p>Absorbs the life force of your foes as you kill them.</p><p>As long as this talent is active, vim will decrease by 0.5 per turn and increase by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6.0, 9.4, 12, 14, 16</acronym> for each kill of a non-undead creature (in addition to the usual increase based on Willpower).</p>